{"id": "68714", "title": "婚后宠恋／我脱你闪", "author": "南窈窕", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 30, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68714.htm", "intro": "新婚夜，他粗暴的扯掉了她的被子和枕头。\r\n\r\n她哭着求他：“我们还不熟悉的啊。”\r\n\r\n男子的嘴角微微的上扬，魅惑的咬着她的耳朵喘气。\r\n\r\n“乖，我们已经是夫妻了，不是吗？”\r\n\r\n她很委屈，辩解道：“可是…”明明她们只是见过三次面。\r\n\r\n他冷冷的攫住她，一字一句的说：“沈诗意，这是丈夫的权利，你懂了吗？”\r\n\r\n总结就是一个傻里傻气的小姑娘，被某个千年道行的男人给拐回家了。\r\n\r\n有话说：\r\n\r\n甜文，宠文一枚。\r\n\r\n先婚后恋，男主腹黑的驯养小宠物。\r\n\r\n女主却母性细胞大发，小白似的把他当乖乖猫。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68714", "chapters": [{"title": "闪（一） 修改", "file": "10543234.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（二）", "file": "10543235.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（三）", "file": "10543236.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（四）", "file": "10543237.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（五）", "file": "10543238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（六）", "file": "10543239.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（七） 捉虫", "file": "10543240.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（八）", "file": "10543241.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（九）", "file": "10543242.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十）", "file": "10543243.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十一） 捉虫", "file": "10543244.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十二）", "file": "10543245.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十三）", "file": "10543246.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十四）亲们，记得看下面的有话说", "file": "10543247.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十五）", "file": "10543248.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十六）", "file": "10543249.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十七）", "file": "10543250.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十八）", "file": "10543251.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情人节小插曲（福利，不算正文）", "file": "10543252.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（十九）", "file": "10543253.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（二十）", "file": "10543254.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闪（二十一）", "file": "10543255.html", "available": false}, {"title"